// •  System Architecture: Developed and implemented the ControlEntradaSalida script to manage spatial triggers
, enabling the game to recognize player entry/exit events for "START" and "VICTORY" conditions.
•  Interface Logic: Programmed the MainMenuManager script,
 creating a functional flow for the game's start sequence and handling the dynamic activation/deactivation of UI panels.
•  Technical Optimization: Integrated error-handling logs (Debug.LogWarning) 
to ensure the Unity Inspector references are correctly assigned, 
facilitating a smoother collaborative workflow.
•  Asset Management: Responsible for the serialization and metadata integrity of the project's scripts,
 ensuring all Global Identifiers (GUIDs) remain consistent across the development repository.

